  m_text: '<b><size=22><color=#fff6c2>BINGO''S ARE EARNED BY GETTING VERTICAL. HORIZONTAL
    OR

    DIAGONAL GOLDEN LINES OR A GOLDEN SQUARE IN EACH

    CONER PLUS THE CENTER.


    WHENEVER A WILD LANDS IN THE BONUS ROUND IT

    WILL COLOR THE SQUARE GOLD.

    GETTING A BINGO DOUBLES EVERY WIN AFTER A BINGO IS CALLED.</color></size></b>'
