  m_text: "<b><size=19><color=#fff6c2>WELCOME TO THE BINGO LANE SLOT! IN THIS GAME
    YOU WIN BY SPINNING THE REELS\nAND MATCHING SYMBOLS LEFT TO RIGHT. YOU CAN MATCH
    SYMBOLS ON ANY OF THE\n\n25 DIFFERENT WIN LINES! THE WILD SYMBOL                    SUBTITUTES
    FOR ANY\n\nSYMBOL TO HELP YOU GET WINNING COMBINATIONS.\n\n\nTO BEGIN PLAYING
    SIMPLY CHOOSE YOUR DESIRED COIN SIZE ON THE CONTROL\nPANEL BENEATH THE REELS BET
    BUTTONS AND CLICK SPIN BUTTON.\n\n\nYOUR SELECTED COIN SIZE WILL BE MULTIPLIED
    BY 25(THE NUMBER OF LINES YOU CAN \nWIN ON). ANY WINNINGS WILL BE ADDED TO YOUR
    BALANCE AT THE END OF EACH SPIN!</color></size></b>"
